{"task_id": "Mbpp/6", "solution": "def differ_At_One_Bit_Pos(num1: int, num2: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if two non-negative integers differ at exactly one bit position.\n    Returns True if they differ by exactly one bit, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    xor_result = num1 ^ num2\n    count = 0\n    while xor_result > 0:\n        xor_result &= (xor_result - 1)\n        count += 1\n    return count == 1"}
