{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "```python\ndef count_Substrings(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts substrings where the sum of their digits equals their length.\n    It iterates through all possible substrings, calculating their sum and length incrementally.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(s)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_sum += int(s[j])  # Sum of digits for the current substring\n            current_length = j - i + 1  # Length of the current substring\n\n            if current_sum == current_length:\n                count += 1\n    return count\n```"}
