{"task_id": "Mbpp/65", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import Union, Any\n\ndef recursive_list_sum(input_list: list) -> Union[int, float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all numeric elements within a potentially nested list.\n    Raises TypeError if input is not a list.\n    Ignores elements that are neither numbers nor lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(input_list, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a list.\")\n\n    total_sum: Union[int, float] = 0\n\n    for element in input_list:\n        if isinstance(element, (int, float)):\n            total_sum += element\n        elif isinstance(element, list):\n            total_sum += recursive_list_sum(element)\n    return total_sum\n```"}
