{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "```python\ndef comb_sort(data: list) -> None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts a list of elements in-place using the comb sort algorithm.\n    The list is sorted in ascending order.\n    \"\"\"\n    SHRINK_FACTOR = 1.3\n\n    n = len(data)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return\n\n    gap = n\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap != 1 or swapped:\n        # Calculate next gap value\n        gap = int(gap / SHRINK_FACTOR)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if data[i] > data[i + gap]:\n                data[i], data[i + gap] = data[i + gap], data[i]\n                swapped = True\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "```python\ndef comb_sort(data_list):\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of numbers in ascending order using the Comb Sort algorithm, in-place.\"\"\"\n    n = len(data_list)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return data_list\n\n    gap = n\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        gap = int(gap / shrink_factor)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if data_list[i] > data_list[i + gap]:\n                data_list[i], data_list[i + gap] = data_list[i + gap], data_list[i]\n                swapped = True\n    return data_list\n```"}
