{"task_id": "Mbpp/77", "solution": "```python\ndef is_Diff(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if an integer is divisible by 11 using the alternating sum of digits rule.\"\"\"\n    num_str = str(abs(number))\n    alternating_sum = 0\n    for i, digit_char in enumerate(num_str):\n        digit = int(digit_char)\n        # Adds digits at even positions from the right, subtracts digits at odd positions.\n        if (len(num_str) - 1 - i) % 2 == 0:\n            alternating_sum += digit\n        else:\n            alternating_sum -= digit\n    \n    return alternating_sum % 11 == 0\n```"}
