{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "```python\ndef zero_count(data: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in a list of integers.\n    Returns 0.0 if there are no non-zero elements to prevent division by zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    zero_count = 0\n    non_zero_count = 0\n    for item in data:\n        if item == 0:\n            zero_count += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_count += 1\n\n    if non_zero_count == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    return float(zero_count) / non_zero_count\n```"}
