{"task_id": "Mbpp/267", "solution": "```python\ndef square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n    Negative n is treated as 0 for the calculation.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        n = 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        odd_number = (2 * i - 1)\n        total_sum += odd_number * odd_number\n    return total_sum\n```"}
