{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "```python\ndef factorial(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    if num == 0:\n        return 1\n    result = 1\n    for i in range(1, num + 1):\n        result *= i\n    return result\n\ndef calculate_binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Optimization: C(n, k) = C(n, n-k)\n    if k > n // 2:\n        k = n - k\n\n    n_fact = factorial(n)\n    k_fact = factorial(k)\n    nk_fact = factorial(n - k)\n    \n    return n_fact // (k_fact * nk_fact)\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given n.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):  # Iterate through even indices\n        total_sum += calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n            \n    return total_sum\n```"}
