{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "```python\ndef find_lucas(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the Nth Lucas number iteratively.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    a, b = 2, 1\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return b\n```"}
