{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "```python\n# _perrin_memo stores computed Perrin numbers for memoization.\n_perrin_memo = {\n    0: 3,\n    1: 0,\n    2: 2\n}\n\ndef _get_perrin_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth Perrin number using memoization.\"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a non-negative integer.\")\n    if n in _perrin_memo:\n        return _perrin_memo[n]\n\n    result = _get_perrin_number(n - 2) + _get_perrin_number(n - 3)\n    _perrin_memo[n] = result\n    return result\n\ndef cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers up to index n.\"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a non-negative integer.\")\n        \n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        total_sum += _get_perrin_number(i)\n    return total_sum\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "```python\ndef cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(n).\n    It uses an internal memoized helper function for efficiency.\n    \"\"\"\n    _memo = {\n        0: 3,\n        1: 0,\n        2: 2\n    }\n\n    def _calculate_perrin(k: int) -> int:\n        # Calculates the kth Perrin number using memoization.\n        if k < 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a non-negative integer.\")\n        if k in _memo:\n            return _memo[k]\n\n        _memo[k] = _calculate_perrin(k - 2) + _calculate_perrin(k - 3)\n        return _memo[k]\n\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a non-negative integer.\")\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterates from 0 to n (inclusive) to sum Perrin numbers.\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        total_sum += _calculate_perrin(i)\n    return total_sum\n```"}
