{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "```python\ndef sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given integer.\n    Returns 0 if the number is non-positive or has no even factors.\"\"\"\n    if number <= 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, number + 1):\n        if number % i == 0 and i % 2 == 0:\n            total_sum += i\n    return total_sum\n```"}
