{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "```python\ndef sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given positive integer.\n    Assumes the input 'number' is a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    factors = set()\n\n    # Find factors by iterating up to the square root of the number.\n    for i in range(1, int(number**0.5) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            factors.add(i)\n            factors.add(number // i)\n\n    # Sum only the factors that are even.\n    for factor in factors:\n        if factor % 2 == 0:\n            total_sum += factor\n    return total_sum\n```"}
