{"task_id": "Mbpp/463", "solution": "```python\ndef max_subarray_product(nums):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum product of a contiguous subarray within the given list of integers.\n    Handles empty arrays by returning 0, and processes all integer inputs directly.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not nums:\n        return 0\n\n    max_so_far = nums[0]\n    min_so_far = nums[0]\n    result = max_so_far\n\n    for i in range(1, len(nums)):\n        curr = nums[i]\n        \n        # Calculate potential new max and min products ending at curr\n        # temp_max stores the current max_so_far before it's updated\n        temp_max = max(curr, max_so_far * curr, min_so_far * curr)\n        min_so_far = min(curr, max_so_far * curr, min_so_far * curr)\n\n        max_so_far = temp_max\n        result = max(result, max_so_far)\n\n    return result\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/463", "solution": "```python\ndef max_subarray_product(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum product of a contiguous subarray within a given array of integers.\n    This handles positive, negative numbers, zeros, and empty or single-element arrays.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not nums:\n        return 0\n\n    max_so_far = nums[0]\n    min_so_far = nums[0]\n    result = nums[0]\n\n    for i in range(1, len(nums)):\n        current_num = nums[i]\n        \n        # Store max_so_far as it will be updated, but is needed for min_so_far calculation.\n        temp_max = max_so_far\n\n        # The new max_so_far could be the current_num itself, or current_num multiplied by\n        # the previous max_so_far or min_so_far (if min_so_far is very negative).\n        max_so_far = max(current_num, current_num * temp_max, current_num * min_so_far)\n        # The new min_so_far similarly considers current_num, or product with previous max/min.\n        min_so_far = min(current_num, current_num * temp_max, current_num * min_so_far)\n\n        # Update the global result with the largest maximum product found so far.\n        result = max(result, max_so_far)\n\n    return result\n```\n"}
