{"task_id": "Mbpp/556", "solution": "def find_Odd_Pair(arr: list[int], n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts pairs (arr[i], arr[j]) where arr[i] ^ arr[j] is odd.\n    An XOR sum is odd if one number is odd and the other is even, enabling an O(N) solution.\n    \"\"\"\n    actual_length = len(arr)\n    if actual_length < 2:\n        return 0\n\n    even_count = 0\n    odd_count = 0\n\n    for x in arr:\n        if x % 2 == 0:\n            even_count += 1\n        else:\n            odd_count += 1\n    \n    return even_count * odd_count"}
