{"task_id": "Mbpp/605", "solution": "```python\ndef prime_num(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if an integer is a prime number.\n    It efficiently determines primality by trial division up to the square root.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n == 2:\n        return True\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 2\n    return True\n```"}
