{"task_id": "Mbpp/607", "solution": "```python\nimport re\nfrom typing import Tuple\n\ndef find_literals(text: str, pattern: str) -> Tuple[str, int, int]:\n    \"\"\"Searches the given text for the first occurrence of a regex pattern.\n    Returns (matched_string, start_index, end_index), or (\"\", -1, -1) if no match or empty text.\"\"\"\n    if not text:\n        return \"\", -1, -1\n\n    match = re.search(pattern, text)\n    if match:\n        return match.group(0), match.start(), match.end()\n    else:\n        return \"\", -1, -1\n```"}
