{"task_id": "Mbpp/631", "solution": "```python\ndef replace_spaces(text: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Replaces whitespaces with an underscore and vice versa in a given string.\n\n    If the string contains spaces, it replaces them with underscores.\n    If the string contains underscores and no spaces, it replaces underscores with spaces.\n    If the string contains neither, or both, it prioritizes replacing spaces with underscores.\n\n    Args:\n        text: The input string.\n\n    Returns:\n        The transformed string.\n\n    Raises:\n        TypeError: If the input is not a string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(text, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a string.\")\n\n    if ' ' in text:\n        return text.replace(' ', '_')\n    elif '_' in text:\n        return text.replace('_', ' ')\n    else:\n        return text\n```"}
