{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef wind_chill(velocity: float, temperature: float) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the wind chill index based on temperature and wind velocity.\n    Rounds the result up to the next integer.\"\"\"\n    if velocity == 0:\n        return math.ceil(temperature)\n\n    # Canadian Wind Chill Index formula (Celsius, km/h)\n    # WCI = 13.12 + 0.6215*T - 11.37*V^0.16 + 0.3965*T*V^0.16\n    wind_chill_index = (\n        13.12\n        + (0.6215 * temperature)\n        - (11.37 * (velocity**0.16))\n        + (0.3965 * temperature * (velocity**0.16))\n    )\n    return math.ceil(wind_chill_index)\n```\n"}
