{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(arr, k):\n    \"\"\"Reverses the first k elements of an array in-place.\n    The function returns the modified array.\n    \"\"\"\n    left = 0\n    right = k - 1\n    while left < right:\n        arr[left], arr[right] = arr[right], arr[left]\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n    return arr"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "```python\ndef reverse_Array_Upto_K(array: list, k: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Reverses a segment of the array in-place.\n    The segment includes elements from index 0 up to and including k.\"\"\"\n    start = 0\n    end = k\n    while start < end:\n        array[start], array[end] = array[end], array[start]\n        start += 1\n        end -= 1\n    return array\n```"}
