{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "```python\ndef rotate_right(input_list: list, n: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates a list to the right by n positions.\n    Returns a new list, leaving the original unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    list_length = len(input_list)\n    effective_n = n % list_length\n\n    if effective_n == 0:\n        return list(input_list)\n\n    return input_list[-effective_n:] + input_list[:-effective_n]\n```"}
